Z||000018||mshill||05-13-2001||02:51 PM||||I pickup 84 short shifters for about $4 at the boneyard everytime I see one.  Takes 2<BR>minutes to get off.  When I get a few extras I always throw them up on e-bay and they typically go for $25-$30.||||reg||1
